# Mobile chapter artwork

## Player image

When the active chapter has an `img` and the target is not a clip or official clip, that URL
replaces the item/channel image on the full player and the mini player. Resolve through
`resolvePlayerChapterArtworkUri` so a chapter snapshot missing `img` can still pick it up from the
loaded chapter list. Do not keep showing episode art while a chapter image is available.

## Chapter list

Full-player and episode-detail chapter rows share `ChapterListRow`.

- If **any** chapter in the section has an image, **every** row shows a leading image: the
  chapter `img` when present, otherwise the same item/channel list URL the row would use
  (`getItemPrimaryImageUrl`), otherwise the `CoverImage` system fallback.
- If **no** chapter in the section has an image, omit leading images entirely. Do not fill the
  list with item/channel art just to keep a column.

Use `chapterSectionHasImages` and `resolveChapterRowArtwork` from `@podverse/helpers`. Inside a
pressable row, `CoverImage` is `opensViewer={false}`.
